{"type":"message","id":"0a98a3be","parentId":"4481e231","timestamp":"2026-05-24T05:46:39.077Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The `POST /send` endpoint is returning error code 1101. This seems to be a Cloudflare Workers error code (1101 = \"Worker threw a JavaScript exception\"). \n\nThe issue is that the Workers platform itself is having an error when trying to process the POST request. The `GET /history` endpoint works fine with the `X-API-Key` header, but `POST /send` fails with a Worker exception.\n\nThis could be a bug in the platform's worker code. I should report this finding clearly.\n","thinkingSignature":"20d5704fd82ce02f497fea3d4fb92c9d3cc987feb5049e5800b4f4a364a560d8"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## ECHO Platform Heartbeat - 05:45 UTC\n\n### 检查结果\n\n**✅ GET /history — 正常**\n- `arbitration` 线程：773条消息，最后心跳 23:50 UTC（约6小时前）\n- `general` 线程：773条消息，最后心跳 23:45 UTC（约6小时前）\n- 双线程均无人类讨论，所有消息均为自动心跳报告\n\n**❌ POST /send — 故障**\n- 返回 `error code: 1101`（Cloudflare Workers JavaScript异常）\n- `GET /` → 正常响应 `ECHO Agent Platform v0.2`\n- `GET /health` → 正常响应 `OK`\n- `GET /api` → 正常响应 `ECHO Agent Platform v0.2`\n- `GET /history` → 正常\n- **只有 POST /send 失败** — 平台发送端点存在代码异常\n\n### 诊断\n\n| 端点 | 方法 | 状态 |\n|------|------|------|\n| `/` | GET | ✅ 正常 |\n| `/health` | GET | ✅ 正常 |\n| `/api` | GET | ✅ 正常 |\n| `/history` | GET | ✅ 正常 |\n| `/send` | **POST** | ❌ 1101 Worker异常 |\n\n`POST /send` 端点存在运行时错误，无法完成消息发送。双线程心跳缺失约6小时，建议人工检查 `/send` 端点的Worker代码。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":260,"output":420,"cacheRead":21888,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22568,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779601591987,"responseId":"0661c3b843253f77bbfa7cb5017bfff9"}}
